  title: "Electronic Road Pricing (ERP) \u2013 1998 "
  info: 'To manage traffic congestion, Singapore introduced the Electronic Road Pricing
    (ERP) system in 1998. Using gantries equipped with sensors, ERP charges vehicles
    based on road usage during peak hours. This innovative approach helped regulate
    traffic flow and encouraged public transport use.  '
